    <criterion testable="true">`AssociationResolverApp.tsx` compiles unchanged (import of `EntityLookupConfig` continues to resolve; consumer code sees the extended interface transparently).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`loadEntityConfigs()` populates `regardingRecordNumberField` from the queried `sprk_regardingrecordnumberfield` metadata column on every row of `dynamicEntityConfigs`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`getEntityConfig` and `getAllEntityConfigs` return values from `dynamicEntityConfigs` after the initial load; the hardcoded fallback branches are removed once the const is deleted.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`npm run build` in `src/client/pcf/AssociationResolver/` succeeds with zero errors and zero new warnings.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`/code-review` and `/adr-check` pass at Step 9.5 (or all findings addressed / escalated per CLAUDE.md §6.5).</criterion>
